      "snippet": {
        "line": 277,
        "text": "InTrueCone p₁ p₂ A C : Prop := 0 < A ∧ 2 < A * (1 + (C / A) ^ 2) ∧ 2 < p₁ + p₂ * (C / A) ∧ A * (1 + (C / A) ^ 2) < coneBound (p₁ + p₂ * (C / A)) (p₂ - p₁ * (C / A))  (i.e. 0 < a, 2 < v_s, 2 < P_c, v_s < coneBound P_c J_c)"
      }
